Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|User Groups|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Member
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|User Groups|
	And UserGroup add CP
		|userGroupName|UG UserGroup Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|User Groups|
	And UserGroup assign Member CP
		|userGroupName|UG UserGroup Name|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|User Groups|
	Then UserGroup view Assign Member CP
		|userGroupName|UG UserGroup Name|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
Scenario: Add User Group
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|User Groups|
	When UserGroup add CP
		|userGroupName|UG UserGroup Name|
	Then UserGroup view CP
		|userGroupName|UG UserGroup Name|
Scenario: Add User Group Name Duplicate
Priority: 3
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|User Groups|
	When UserGroup add CP
		|userGroupName|UG UserGroup Name|
	And UserGroup add CP
		|userGroupName|UG UserGroup Name|
		|userGroupNameVariation|Duplicate|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|User Groups|
	Then UserGroup view CP
		|userGroupName|UG UserGroup Name|
Scenario: Add User Group Name With Invalid Characters
Priority: 3
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|User Groups|
	When UserGroup add CP
		|userGroupName|UG UserGroup Name*|
		|userGroupNameVariation|Asterik|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|User Groups|
	And UserGroup add CP
		|userGroupName|UG UserGroup Name,|
		|userGroupNameVariation|Comma|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|User Groups|
	And UserGroup add CP
		|userGroupName| |
		|userGroupNameVariation|Null|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|User Groups|
	And UserGroup add CP
		|userGroupName|1|
		|userGroupNameVariation|Number|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|User Groups|
	Then UserGroup view Default
Scenario: Add User Groups
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
