	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|User Groups|
	And UserGroup view CP
		|userGroupName|UG UserGroup1 Name|
	And UserGroup view CP
		|userGroupName|UG UserGroup2 Name|
	Then UserGroup view CP
		|userGroupName|UG UserGroup3 Name|
