Scenario: Search Current Members Assigned To User Group
Priority: 3
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|CPUsergroups#SearchCurrentMembersAssignedToUserGroup|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Server Administration|
	And ServerAdministration execute Server Resources Actions
		|actionsDescription|Reindex all search indexes.|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|User Groups|
	And UserGroup add CP
		|userGroupName|UG UserGroup Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|User Groups|
	And UserGroup assign Member CP
		|userGroupName|UG UserGroup Name|
		|userScreenName|test|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|User Groups|
	And UserGroup assign Member CP
		|userGroupName|UG UserGroup Name|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And UserGroup search Members In User Group CP
		|searchTerm|usersn|
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'usersn' at locator 'UsersAndOrganizationsAssignOrganizationalRoles#USER_TABLE_SCREEN_NAME_1'
	Then AssertNotVisible at locator 'UsersAndOrganizationsAssignOrganizationalRoles#USER_TABLE_SCREEN_NAME_2'
